{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/ihhy7sg96mevtnc072b4xbsfiarhyhe.mp3","text":"等候您的命令，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/h5ayu9kud2mmtz1mra7uxoab274a8og.mp3","text":"生化小组的两位前辈也在这里？那......以后能把我分配到前辈们的行动组吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/18/t17mnuev8lgm2f091b9z0bozyultew9.mp3","text":"呼哈......呼哈......再做三组体能训练......今天的锻炼就完成了......一半......博士......麻烦您帮我......拿下水壶......","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/54dgga7t5kezsm53z35qd320bd4btmc.mp3","text":"想问我家乡的情况？那是片......残酷的荒漠，每天光是活着就很累了。和那里比起来，罗德岛就是天堂啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/c0t5ctd2azz5uoy8g2xzfdkorni3wtf.mp3","text":"比起在黑钢实习的时候，我变得更强了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/83/pvmo7xdck6kezro1q2sk76o7xp6q6iv.mp3","text":"黑钢的第二十二条规定：“武器离身者一律辞退”，所以我一直随身带着我的斧枪。唉？平时不用？但我记得......稍等......“此规定仅限入职训练与契约中干员。”......芙兰卡小姐为什么没提醒我呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/jk6wi6fo38oqu69sk9fip147an6nl3i.mp3","text":"杜宾教官太残忍了！为什么只有我要面对活生生的源石蜗牛呢！我，我真的下不了手啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/ctguuvqhvs652idblp9natx9j9tuwj1.mp3","text":"我想......我明白芙兰卡和雷蛇待在罗德岛的原因了。可能和黑钢相比，这里更像个家吧。除了任务之外，居然还有那么多有趣的东西......","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/sa4lhbzfjwisz4svrlprtb2zzlwk0xr.mp3","text":"嘘，安静点，别打扰博士休息。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/szsb11wzr5ofpyibahj2zvfu77ruh3v.mp3","text":"香草，以受训干员的身份前来学习。博士阁下，今后就请您多多指教了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/rnga73g19ih2w5vrw046nie2apacudv.mp3","text":"是时候整理笔记了，新知识得赶紧消化掉。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/mevo9ob20a39zlrhd5vsce92ws2qjn9.mp3","text":"这是......晋升勋章？给我的？谢，谢谢！","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/25xkj4qzcv8fjd3l8aoiznwe5dff3n8.mp3","text":"香草会助大家一臂之力的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/goesrbzu618z8ag073xks2eqvfgvv3n.mp3","text":"我的话，真的可以吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/pka55ncuoy3630mfici2ltkq1q8klwm.mp3","text":"我会加倍努力的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/geybqarnq7zk3xb6wyc72dqwlkjfupv.mp3","text":"不能给黑钢的各位丢脸！","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/1nn9vtqmvuoqjjy5fhugu9nbkn93ny2.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/hffq2gcl0etb5ouvc4x4zift6wa6x3v.mp3","text":"我会听从命令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/39gof2w2txj1g2e3xarnd80c83bi15x.mp3","text":"好的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/fevu4ayohzvbmoga6dh4my45140hexd.mp3","text":"明白。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/16kt5qjowbem6nnk6t95occoh1uu2rr.mp3","text":"不会让你过去！","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/61/8kdb27t7yl0oi0br39tjgd2golr0a0r.mp3","text":"这把斧头可不是装饰品！","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/62bpnwdgeqlr3d0gzbu51t591fbgukv.mp3","text":"战斗可不仅仅是依靠经验！","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/2ckny10zlhg9w6kqv5teazs3z0lvesb.mp3","text":"接下我这一击！","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/hehcpxbwjrgy9289a29vvh2j40h7qlr.mp3","text":"呼，大圆满！","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/i66zuyxdhb2dp78aakbba8i8xo3xfja.mp3","text":"很成功的作战。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/bfzhl23ei32ipqq0zma850annzrbltp.mp3","text":"如果再努力些的话，结果会更好点吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/piojda3gqxpqcwhg0ff2yao0l7ux6a1.mp3","text":"我......能力还不够......","alt":"voice_cn/char_240_wyvern/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/pwrevvw1g0lwr4fm7yon6trwv79cz7p.mp3","text":"听从您的指挥。","alt":"voice_cn